  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Install once per machine",
      "items": [
        "One line: curl -fsSL …/main/tools/cache-clock/install.sh | sh downloads a copy, staged and swapped in whole; a failed download leaves nothing",
        "From a clone: sh tools/cache-clock/install.sh links (git pull updates it), --copy copies, --uninstall removes; rerun either to update",
        "An existing target is replaced only if it is a symlink or holds extension.mjs",
        "Not per repo: only the hooks permission is asked per repo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Permission prompt, measured",
      "items": [
        "Denied: ExtensionDeniedError in ~/.copilot/logs/",
        "copilot --resume showed the prompt twice",
        "In copilot -p the permission is auto-granted, but /cache-clock needs the interactive CLI"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "VS Code, measured 11-12 Oct 2026",
      "items": [
        "Loads from a project install (install.sh --project: .github/extensions/cache-clock), only with \"chat.canvases.enabled\": true (experimental); reload and start a new chat",
        "Typed in full, /cache-clock works but is not listed in the / menu; its card shows as a question with OK",
        "Heads-up and sending-cold note reach only VS Code's log; sessions keep usage checkpoints, so the report counts totals"
      ]
    }
  ]
